-- EbonClearance German (deDE) locale.
--
-- Community translation template. Each key below is the exact English source
-- string; replace its "" value with the German translation. An entry left as
-- "" falls back to English, so partial translations are safe to ship.
--
-- RULES (see docs/TRANSLATING.md):
--   * Keep every format placeholder (%s, %d, %.1f, ...) - same count, same
--     type. You may reorder words around them; you may NOT add or drop one.
--   * Keep every color code intact: |cffxxxxxx ... |r stays exactly as-is.
--   * No em dashes. Use a plain hyphen with spaces ( - ), comma, or period.
--   * Do not edit the keys (left-hand strings). Only fill the values.
--   * Run  lua tests/test_locale_integrity.lua  before submitting.
--   * German often runs longer than English; if a translated label looks
--     clipped in-game, shorten the wording.

